# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
awg-gen-config — interactive AmneziaWG 3.1 server config updater for Docker.

What it does:
  * reads an existing awg0.conf from a Docker container;
  * preserves PrivateKey, Address, ListenPort and every [Peer] section;
  * replaces only AmneziaWG obfuscation/protocol parameters;
  * creates host-side backups before every write/restore;
  * can restore any backup;
  * restarts the container after applying a config;
  * uses Python stdlib only.

Generation rules are based on the current Any-Tech-ARCHITECT generator and
AmneziaWG 3.x implementation, with AWG 3.1 RandomTrailers/DisableCookies added.
"""

